{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/a630778824ee5f53f62978e0b7396fe5.poster.avif?t=1775852363\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/a630778824ee5f53f62978e0b7396fe5.webm?t=1775852363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/a630778824ee5f53f62978e0b7396fe5.mp4?t=1775852363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/b668876027b0dc0f5e0014f129910469.poster.avif?t=1775852363\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/b668876027b0dc0f5e0014f129910469.webm?t=1775852363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/b668876027b0dc0f5e0014f129910469.mp4?t=1775852363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/6bfa31c46fff1fb5995d3d841d92e43e.poster.avif?t=1775852363\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/6bfa31c46fff1fb5995d3d841d92e43e.webm?t=1775852363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/6bfa31c46fff1fb5995d3d841d92e43e.mp4?t=1775852363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/e7b9d508746de8cdb8e37c1282d4c548.avif?t=1775852363\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepared for the night\u00a0\ud83c\udf1c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and night in the backlands increase the need for provisions and defense. When the sunlight fades, new threats will emerge. And new guides too! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accompanied on the journey\u00a0\ud83d\udc10</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo journey deep into the backlands can be very dangerous. Who knows, you might find someone (or something) who will serve as your companion. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipped for adventure\u00a0\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenges of the backlands require equipment. Use your machete and hoe for vital tasks like gathering water, food, and clearing paths. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recipes to practice\u00a0\ud83d\uddd2\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in the backlands requires its own science. The fauna and flora are unique, so be sure to learn the recipes available for crafting with typical items from the region.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact to survive\u00a0\ud83d\udc65</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger and thirst can be quite cruel in times of drought. Interact with locals and travelers of the backlands to gain access to new stories and learning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore to know\u00a0\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the most arid regions to learn more about the backlands and find the resources you need to stay afloat. A full inventory is always a good idea!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stories to learn\u00a0\u2728</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The backlands are a special place, with unique stories that only happen there. Venture out to find lost objects and stories from other travelers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A game made with soul, care, and respect.\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f\ud83c\udf35\ud83c\udfae</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/a48e4c921d054800bfb3ed787d082072.avif?t=1775852363\" width=780 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The drought this time came much stronger and changed daily life here in the backlands. Many plantations were lost, animals died and families abandoned their homes. It is in this scenario that C\u00edcera lives, a curious young girl who uses the advice of her grandfather and other villagers to learn how to survive and strengthen herself to face the drought and realize her greatest dream: exploring the backlands to reunite with her parents.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/d91381a580643a5de5123e80e6e197d4.avif?t=1775852363\" width=780 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00c1RIDA 2: Rise of the Brave</strong> is the second of three games that will present Cicera's journey in the Brazilian backlands of the nineteenth century. Follow us to stay connected with all the news about \u00c1RIDA. Let\u00b4s build this story together! \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/7ce7fafa4438a2585f65917829c52074.avif?t=1775852363\" width=780 height=130 /></span>We create narrative games deeply inspired by Brazilian popular culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00c1RIDA 2 is part of a trilogy dedicated to the memory of the heroic town of Canudos. Our work celebrates all the anonymous figures who fight and have fought to build stories and legacies of resistance and solidarity in Brazil and around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long live Canudos!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1212030?t=1775852363","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/529342de8a20abd043ac1d871457a68edb89cebc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775852363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/b198c4f757bfff46f83846fb765a914f29546e4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775852363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/b198c4f757bfff46f83846fb765a914f29546e4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775852363","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/a630778824ee5f53f62978e0b7396fe5.poster.avif?t=1775852363\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/a630778824ee5f53f62978e0b7396fe5.webm?t=1775852363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/a630778824ee5f53f62978e0b7396fe5.mp4?t=1775852363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/b668876027b0dc0f5e0014f129910469.poster.avif?t=1775852363\" width=1