store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/d91381a580643a5de5123e80e6e197d4.avif?t=1775852363\" width=780 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00c1RIDA 2: Rise of the Brave</strong> is the second of three games that will present Cicera's journey in the Brazilian backlands of the nineteenth century. Follow us to stay connected with all the news about \u00c1RIDA. Let\u00b4s build this story together! \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/extras/7ce7fafa4438a2585f65917829c52074.avif?t=1775852363\" width=780 height=130 /></span>We create narrative games deeply inspired by Brazilian popular culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00c1RIDA 2 is part of a trilogy dedicated to the memory of the heroic town of Canudos. Our work celebrates all the anonymous figures who fight and have fought to build stories and legacies of resistance and solidarity in Brazil and around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long live Canudos!</strong></p>","developers":["Aoca Game Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212030/cda1ee4dbc433d0366eda0c09deb93267380b358/header.jpg?t=1775852363","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1212030/148340961/090493c4ebc9d1a5764f0448946f3275cd3e1196/1767885894/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767890859","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1212030/148340961/090493c4ebc9d1a5764f0448946f3275cd3e1196/1767885894/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767890859","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1212030/148340961/090493c4ebc9d1a5764f0448946f3275cd3e1196/1767885894/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767890859","